{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32639","headline":"宿题天坛观 · 刘沧","name":"宿题天坛观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沐髪清斋宿洞宫，桂花松韵满岩风。\n紫霞晓色秋山霁，碧落寒光霜月空。\n华表鹤声天外迥，蓬莱仙界海门通。\n冥心一悟虚无理，寂寞玄珠象罔中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}